# p5 mcp discover: a 2026-07-28 HTTP server whose `server/discover` answer comes as one event on a stream
# it then holds open (mcphttp.ts `ssehold`). fx v0.0.16 reads each event as it comes
# (`readEvents`, src/mcp/io/http.zig:643-692@481104fd), so it is ready at 2026-07-28 at once.
# `gwlog` copies the server log.
mcphttp ssehold
fx: homefile .fx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-http-profile.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-http-profile.json
gateway p5-mcp-hello.json
wait 6
type /mcp show fixture
key Enter
wait 3
snap show
gwlog
